WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.082
Treat each code cell as one stage of a larger workflow.

00:00:04.082 --> 00:00:09.917
Before you run it, identify what goes into the step and what should come out.

00:00:09.917 --> 00:00:17.860
For example, a train-test split takes one dataset and produces separate training and testing subsets.

00:00:18.405 --> 00:00:24.522
Run the example, inspect shapes and outputs, and then change one setting at a time.

00:00:24.522 --> 00:00:29.724
Machine learning code becomes easier when you understand the purpose of each stage.
